      "content": "but it doesn't feel like their struggle. i see it in their eyes. they're just tired of dealing with me. i'm just constantly taking and taking, and all i give back is more stress and sadness. if i were gone, it wouldn't be a tragedy for them, it would just be... peace. like a weight finally being lifted off their shoulders. wouldn't that be the most selfless thing i could actually do?",
